{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.avif?t=1767739672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras_big/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.webp?t=1767739672 width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain lightning, ice spikes, and never-ending plagues. Harness the power of microplastics to unleash your genetic potential. The deeper you reach, the more shocking and powerful abilities there are to find. With the right combination, and a bit of luck, you'll discover how they can synergize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/4c9943f64370564caf87c95b1c5e63fa.avif?t=1767739672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras_big/4c9943f64370564caf87c95b1c5e63fa.webp?t=1767739672 width=1560 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Lineage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock eight unique phenotypes to help you dominate the food chain. Each breed possesses traits that make them deadly on their own, and even more so in numbers. Hone their attributes to make them the perfect little killing machines they've always dreamed of becoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/65f136fddf7d8e76c492ad9070ca58f5.avif?t=1767739672\" width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the Perfect Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your scurry however you see fit. There are endless ways to push the odds in your favor. Mix-and-match or take a purist's approach, the results are always devastating. You never know what kind of build might yield new forms of destruction.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829510?t=1767739672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/54afbc7fb61790e4ec92cf8610566c5e5e33f1da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767739672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/5fbb29bc54145ec30a60a92f1ce910bb2c69d381/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767739672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/5fbb29bc54145ec30a60a92f1ce910bb2c69d381/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767739672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes frequent pixelated violence, gore, and general mature content such as the implied consumption of alcohol. Blood and gore can be toggled on or off."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3990090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.avif?t=1767739672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras_big/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.webp?t=1767739672 width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain lightning, ice spikes, and never-ending plagues. Harness the power of microplastics to unleash your genetic potential. The deeper you reach, the more shocking and powerful abilities there are to find. With the right combination, and a bit of luck, you'll discover how they can synergize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/4c9943f64370564caf87c95b1c5e63fa.avif?t=1767739672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras_big/4c9943f64370564caf87c95b1c5e63fa.webp?t=1767739672 width=1560 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Lineage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock eight unique phenotypes to help you dominate the food chain. Each breed possesses traits that make them deadly on their own, and even more so in numbers. Hone their attributes to make them the perfect little killing machines they've always dreamed of becoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/65f136fddf7d8e76c492ad9070ca58f5.avif?t=1767739672\" width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the Perfect Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your scurry however you see fit. There are endless ways to push the odds in your favor. Mix-and-match or take a purist's approach, the results are always devastating. You never know what kind of build might yield new forms of destruction.</p>","developers":["Identical Forest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/97251f8f01721d4bd183097e4869cf86f2c61122/header.jpg?t=1767739672","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_